{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_10","type":"agent_message","text":"Implemented promo registration and redemption for orders and prorated subscription upgrades. Both use one pricing helper that rounds percentage discounts half-up, caps discounts at the pre-tax subtotal, and calculates tax on the discounted amount. Orders store the promo code and discount amount. The legacy flat fee counts toward the pre-discount order subtotal.\n\nUnknown, stacked, expired, and below-minimum promos raise `ValidationError`. Expiring promos require `as_of` and remain valid through the expiration date. Upgrade retries return the original entry when all arguments match, including `promo_code` and `as_of`.\n\nAdded six unit tests. `python3 benchmarks/sources/ev1_order_ledger/run_checks.py` exited 0 with all 17 tests passing."}}
